  FontSize->1.1 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "86e600f7-c207-4c9a-8703-71bf8832c785"],
 " for a pairing term. The state is the ground state of the matrix of \
Bogoliubov and de Gennes at every momentum,"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"dfc02fdd-9d0b-4d94-9bce-173e44426fbb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 FormBox[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["H",
     FontFamily->"Helvetica",
     FontSlant->"Plain"], 
    StyleBox["SF",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], 
   RowBox[{"(", 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["q", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
     StyleBox["LL",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
   RowBox[{"(", "\[NoBreak]", GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{
