temperatures from 0.01 to 0.6 (from 1.11338 to 0.584946; the largest rise), \
so T_c is the only solution of lambda^P(T) = 1 there", 
   "   [the same check: Rust ", "P3-T9 HS_0_0", ", Python ", "YP3-T9 HS_0_0", 
   "]"],
  Editable->False]], "Print",
 CellChangeTimes->{4.004297005540844*^9},
 CellLabel->
